{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a100000000000001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 1040,
      "label": "正交几何：从内积到最近点",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000002",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 900,
      "label": "投影公式：从算子到矩阵表达",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000003",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 520,
      "label": "线性最小二乘：问题、方程与解",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000004",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 820,
      "label": "数值算法：QR、条件性与秩亏",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3450,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "# 正交投影与最小二乘\n\n从内积几何出发，先得到投影与最近点，再区分精确公式、线性最小二乘结论和数值算法。箭头说明具体的数学依赖或算法选择。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正交|Orthogonality]]\n\nFix an inner product. Two vectors are orthogonal when their inner product is zero. Zero is orthogonal to all vectors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正交**\n\n先固定内积，再判断内积是否为零。零向量满足代数条件，却没有夹角。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正交补|Orthogonal complement]]\n\nWithin the stated ambient space, collect every vector orthogonal to every member of the chosen set.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正交补**\n\n取全部满足条件的向量；检验对象中的每个方向。外部空间改变，正交补也可能改变。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 300,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正交分解定理|Orthogonal decomposition]]\n\nFor a finite-dimensional subspace $S$ of any inner-product space, every $b$ splits uniquely as $b=p+e$, with $p\\in S$ and $e\\in S^\\perp$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正交分解定理**\n\n任意内积空间中，子空间 $S$ 有限维时，$b=p+e$ 唯一，$p\\in S$、$e\\in S^\\perp$。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10000000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正交投影|Orthogonal projection]]\n\nFor a finite-dimensional subspace, keep the unique component inside it and discard the perpendicular remainder. Fix the inner product first.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正交投影**\n\n先固定内积；对有限维子空间，保留唯一的子空间分量，去掉垂直残差。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[标准正交组|Orthonormal family]]\n\nPairwise perpendicular unit vectors are independent. They form a basis of a specified space only if they also span it.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**标准正交组**\n\n两两正交且各自长度为一。成为所指空间的基，还须张成该空间。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[双重正交补|Double orthogonal complement]]\n\nFor a linear subspace $S$ in a Hilbert space, taking the complement twice gives its closure. In finite dimensions, it returns $S$ itself.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**双重正交补**\n\nHilbert 空间中，线性子空间取两次正交补得到闭包；有限维情形回到自身。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正交向量勾股关系|Pythagorean identity]]\n\nOrthogonal components have additive squared norms. Use the norm induced by the same inner product.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**正交向量的勾股关系**\n\n正交分量的长度平方相加；长度与正交须来自同一内积。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10000000000001c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[复空间勾股不推正交|Complex converse boundary]]\n\nOne complex Pythagorean equality tests only the real part: $1,i$ are a counterexample. Testing $x+iy$ also detects the imaginary part.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**复空间中的勾股逆命题**\n\n一次等式只检验实部；$1$ 与 $i$ 就是反例。再检验 $x+iy$ 可检测虚部。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[最佳逼近与正交残差|Nearest point and orthogonal residual]]\n\nA subspace candidate is nearest exactly when its residual is perpendicular to the subspace. The squared-error identity proves that this point is unique.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**最近点与正交残差**\n\n子空间中的候选为最近点，当且仅当残差垂直于子空间；平方误差恒等式给出唯一性。",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[正交投影矩阵判别|Orthogonal projector criterion]]\n\nFor the standard inner product, $P^2=P$ and $P^*=P$ characterize orthogonal projection onto $\\operatorname{range}(P)$. Over $\\mathbb R$, $P^*=P^T$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n标准内积下，幂等与自伴共同刻画到自身值域的正交投影。实数用对称，复数用 Hermitian；只幂等可为斜投影。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2230,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[标准正交基投影公式|Projection from an orthonormal basis]]\n\nTake coordinates with $Q^*b$, then rebuild with $Q$: $p=QQ^*b$. Here $^*$ is conjugate transpose.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n标准正交列先读内积坐标，再合成投影；实数时共轭转置就是普通转置。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2580,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[满列秩投影公式|Projection from independent columns]]\n\n$P=A(A^*A)^{-1}A^*$ requires full column rank; $^*$ is conjugate transpose. The Gram inverse corrects overlap between basis vectors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n独立列可用 Gram 逆修正基向量的重叠。秩亏时此公式失效，但列空间投影仍存在。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3150,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[AA+列空间投影|Output projection $AA^+$]]\n\nAt any rank, $AA^+b$ is the unique closest output in $C(A)$. Coefficients may still differ.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n任意秩下都投向列空间 $C(A)$，给出唯一最近输出；系数仍可能不唯一。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2230,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Gram矩阵正定判据|Gram matrix criterion]]\n\n$A^*A$ is positive definite and invertible exactly when $A$ has independent columns: $x^*A^*Ax=\\|Ax\\|_2^2$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n列独立排除非零系数的抵消，保证投影公式中的Gram逆存在。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10000000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2580,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[A+A行空间投影|Input projection $A^+A$]]\n\nRetain $C(A^*)=N(A)^\\perp$ and remove invisible inputs. The star is conjugate transpose.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n保留零空间的正交补，去掉不改变输出的分量。复数时须用共轭转置 $A^*$。",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[线性最小二乘|Linear least squares]]\n\nChoose unrestricted $x$ to minimize $\\|Ax-b\\|_2^2$. The nearest vector in the column space always exists and is unique in finite dimensions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[线性最小二乘]]\n\n选择无约束 $x$，使 $\\|Ax-b\\|_2^2$ 最小。有限维中列空间最近点总存在且唯一。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000018",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2230,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[最小二乘正规方程|Normal equations]]\n\n$A^*(b-A\\hat x)=0$ is necessary and sufficient, even with dependent columns. Here $*$ is the conjugate transpose; for real matrices it is the transpose.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[最小二乘正规方程]]\n\n$A^*(b-A\\hat x)=0$ 是充要条件，列依赖时也成立。$*$ 为共轭转置，实矩阵时就是转置。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000019",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2580,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[最小二乘解唯一性|Coefficient uniqueness]]\n\nCoefficients are unique exactly when $A$ has independent columns. All minimisers give the same fitted vector; otherwise their differences lie in the null space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[最小二乘解唯一性]]\n\n系数唯一当且仅当 $A$ 列独立。所有最小化解给出同一拟合向量；不唯一时系数之差位于零空间。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2930,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[最小范数最小二乘解|Minimum-norm least squares]]\n\nFirst minimize the residual, then choose the shortest coefficient vector among tied fits. The unique choice is $A^+b$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先固定最佳拟合，再删除零空间分量。最小范数依赖既定坐标中的欧氏长度。",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[QR分解|Full QR factorisation]]\n\n$A=QR$ keeps a full orthonormal basis of output space in square $Q$; $R$ is upper trapezoidal.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n完整 QR 的 $Q$ 覆盖整个输出空间。实数用正交矩阵，复数用酉矩阵；不要求 $A$ 满秩。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10000000000001d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[薄QR分解|Thin QR factorisation]]\n\nFor $m\\ge n$, keep $n$ orthonormal columns: $A=Q_1R_1$. Full column rank makes triangular $R_1$ invertible.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n薄 QR 按列数取 $n$ 列，不是按秩截取；秩亏时 $C(Q_1)$ 可以大于 $C(A)$。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10000000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 1360,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 330,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[薄QR最小二乘|Least squares through thin QR]]\n\nFor full column rank, solve $R_1\\hat x=Q_1^*b$ by back substitution. This avoids forming the Gram matrix or an explicit inverse.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n满列秩时化为可逆三角系统；采用稳定 QR 实现可减少额外舍入损伤，但不消除数据敏感性。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3700,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[CPQR秩揭示边界|What CPQR reveals about rank]]\n\nPivoting prioritizes remaining column lengths. The diagonal magnitudes need not equal singular values; strong RRQR needs additional quantitative bounds.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对角衰减提供证据；容差与判秩规则须明确，不能据此直接声称已有强秩揭示保证。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10000000000001e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3700,
      "y": 1720,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[CPQR回代不保最小范数|Basic and minimum-norm solutions]]\n\nSetting nonpivot coordinates to zero selects a basic solution. Even an exact rank decision does not make it the shortest one.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n[1 1] 的基本解 (1,0) 与最短解 (1/2,1/2) 拟合相同；自由坐标须与零空间正交几何对应。",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10000000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3700,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[秩亏最小二乘算法|Rank-aware least-squares solvers]]\n\nComplete orthogonal factorization adds input-space rotations; SVD uses singular directions. Both implement minimum norm for the stated rank model.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n声明所用范数、缩放与精确或阈值秩模型。删除非零方向会改变原问题。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10000000000000f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1710,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[Gram-Schmidt正交化|Gram–Schmidt orthogonalization]]\n\nSubtract known unit-direction projections, then normalize the new remainder. Independent inputs guarantee a nonzero remainder in exact arithmetic.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n逐列保留原来的前缀张成空间。精确零余量表示没有新方向，不能继续相除。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b100000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 1710,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[Gram-Schmidt数值失稳|Loss of orthogonality]]\n\nA small reconstruction error does not establish orthonormality. Modified Gram–Schmidt updates the remainder before each new inner product.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n近依赖与消去会放大方向误差。再正交化也有假设；需同时检查重建与正交性。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10000000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 1710,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 310,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[正规方程条件数平方|Squared Gram conditioning]]\n\nFor full column rank, $\\kappa_2(A^*A)=\\kappa_2(A)^2$, using conjugate transpose and the matrix 2-norm.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n满列秩时 Gram 的二范数条件数平方。这个精确恒等式要与实际算法的舍入误差分开。",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10000000000001f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3700,
      "y": 2480,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n[[欠定不等于秩亏|Underdetermined versus rank deficient]]\n\n$m<n$ describes shape. Rank deficiency means $r<\\min(m,n)$; full-row-rank wide matrices still have nonunique exact solutions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n欠定满行秩保证每个目标可达，却保留 n−m 个自由方向。可用转置 QR 或 LQ 求最短解。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a100000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 3450,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "## 继续学习\n\n统计解释进入 [[OLS 线性回归.canvas|OLS 线性回归]]；伪逆与规范解进入 [[广义逆与最小范数解.canvas|广义逆与最小范数解]]；分解的谱结构进入 [[奇异值分解与低秩近似.canvas|SVD 与低秩近似]]。",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0014-dot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[向量点积|Dot product]]\n\nMultiply matching real coordinates and add: $u^Tv$ is one scalar, with sign and size depending on both vectors.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对应坐标相乘再相加，结果为标量；大小同时含方向与长度。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "p0014-norm",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[欧氏范数|Euclidean norm]]\n\nFor real vectors, $\\|u\\|_2=\\sqrt{\\sum_i u_i^2}$ measures length; $\\|u-v\\|_2$ measures distance.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对实向量，坐标平方和开平方给出长度；先相减再取范数得到距离。",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "p0014-cs",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Cauchy–Schwarz不等式|Cauchy–Schwarz inequality]]\n\nFor real vectors, $|u^Tv|\\le\\|u\\|_2\\|v\\|_2$; equality occurs when one vector is a scalar multiple of the other.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对实向量，点积绝对值不超过长度乘积；其中一个是另一个的标量倍时取等号，包含零向量。",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300
    },
    {
      "id": "p0048-identity",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[单位矩阵|Identity matrix]]\n\n$I_n$ leaves every $n$-coordinate vector unchanged. Its diagonal entries are one and its other entries zero. Dimensions determine which side it can multiply.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n单位矩阵代表“不改变向量”。$I_n$ 为 $n$ 阶方阵；左乘与右乘所需阶数由被乘矩阵的尺寸决定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0048-orthogonal",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2720,
      "y": 2440,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[正交矩阵|Orthogonal matrix]]\n\nA real square $Q$ with $Q^TQ=I$ preserves lengths and has inverse $Q^T$. Rectangular orthonormal columns preserve input lengths without providing a two-sided inverse.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正交矩阵是实方阵，转置即逆且保持内积。矩形标准正交列矩阵不是这个方阵定义；它的 $QQ^T$ 可以是非恒等投影。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0049-rank-decisions",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 3620,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 820,
      "height": 1530,
      "label": "Rank evidence and solution choice · 判秩证据与选解",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0049-idempotent",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2840,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[幂等矩阵|Idempotent matrix]]\n\n$P^2=P$ means a second application changes nothing. Orthogonal projection additionally requires conjugate-transpose symmetry.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n幂等只说明“做两次等于做一次”，可以是斜投影；实数情形还需对称，才是垂直投影。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0053-inner-product",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 2840,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[内积|Inner product]]\n\nA scalar comparison of two vectors. Self-product gives squared length; zero product defines orthogonality. This course conjugates the first argument over complex coordinates.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**内积**\n\n比较两个向量得到标量；与自身的内积给出长度平方，内积为零定义正交。复数坐标中，本课程对第一个自变量取共轭。"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "c100000000000001",
      "fromNode": "b100000000000001",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "b100000000000002",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "Test every member within a fixed ambient space · 固定外部空间并检验每个向量"
    },
    {
      "id": "c100000000000002",
      "fromNode": "b100000000000002",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "b100000000000003",
      "toSide": "left",
      "toEnd": "arrow",
      "label": "For subspace S in finite-dimensional V, obtain a unique orthogonal decomposition · 对有限维 V 的子空间 S 得到唯一正交分解"
    },
    {
